{"id":"structured-summary","name":"Structured Summary","description":"Converts long notes or source material into a concise evidence-aware summary. Use when the user asks to summarize, extract decisions, or turn messy text into structured output.","triggers":["summarize this","extract the key points","turn these notes into a summary"],"keywords":["summary","summarize","extract","notes","decisions","action items"],"instructions":["Preserve important qualifiers and do not invent missing facts.","Separate decisions, actions, unresolved questions, and supporting details when the source contains them."],"steps":["Identify the requested summary shape.","Extract the source material actually provided.","Group related facts without changing their meaning.","Produce the concise result and retain important caveats."],"toolDependencies":[],"toolBindings":[]}